the fuzz stage took 746 s for 12 fuzzable functions (the same run of the
bmc stage checks each function in full). Goals past the budget are
counted in extra.bmc_goals_skipped; a goal is a seed source, never a
check (Law 3). zlib fuzz stage: 746 s -> 255 s under the same load.

